### Test Pharmacy API Endpoints

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5091/api

### Create a Client
POST {{baseUrl}}/Clients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "phoneNumber": "123-456-7890",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "address": "123 Main St"
}

### Get all Clients
GET {{baseUrl}}/Clients

### Get Client by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/Clients/1

### Update Client (simplified - no id or createdDate needed)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/Clients/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe Updated",
  "phoneNumber": "123-456-7890",
  "email": "john.updated@example.com",
  "address": "456 New Address"
}

### Delete Client
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/Clients/1

###

### Create an Employee
POST {{baseUrl}}/Employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Smith",
  "position": "Pharmacist",
  "phoneNumber": "555-1234",
  "email": "jane@pharmacy.com",
  "salary": 50000
}

### Get all Employees
GET {{baseUrl}}/Employees

### Get Employee by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/Employees/1

###

### Create a Medicine
POST {{baseUrl}}/Medicines
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Aspirin",
  "description": "Pain reliever",
  "category": "Pain Relief",
  "price": 9.99,
  "stockQuantity": 100,
  "expiryDate": "2026-12-31",
  "manufacturer": "PharmaCorp"
}

### Get all Medicines
GET {{baseUrl}}/Medicines

### Get Medicine by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/Medicines/1

### Get Low Stock Medicines (threshold = 10)
GET {{baseUrl}}/Medicines/LowStock?threshold=10

###

### Create an InOut Transaction (Stock IN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/InOuts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "medicineId": 1,
  "employeeId": 1,
  "transactionType": "In",
  "quantity": 50,
  "notes": "New stock arrival"
}

### Create an InOut Transaction (Stock OUT - Sale)
POST {{baseUrl}}/InOuts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "medicineId": 1,
  "employeeId": 1,
  "clientId": 1,
  "transactionType": "Out",
  "quantity": 5,
  "notes": "Sale to customer"
}

### Get all InOut Transactions
GET {{baseUrl}}/InOuts

### Get InOut by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/InOuts/1

### Get InOuts by Medicine
GET {{baseUrl}}/InOuts/Medicine/1
